{"name":"Arm warmers (alt style)","deep":true,"image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3c/Arm_warmers.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","credit":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Arm_warmers.JPG","caption":"Arm warmers","source":"Wikimedia Commons"},"mentions":0,"casual":{"lead":["Arm warmers are knitted sleeves that cover the lower arm, often without finger coverings. In alt fashion they are worn for the look: striped or solid sleeves add contrast and layering to an outfit.","Punk, emo, scene and goth subcultures adopted them as a fashion statement, and they are also used by dancers and endurance athletes for warmth."],"sections":[{"h":"How people use it","paras":["They are slipped over the forearm and worn with short-sleeved tops, often in pairs of contrasting stripes or dark colours. The effect is immediate and removable."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks & side effects","paras":["No safety concerns specific to the style; compression sports versions are used for warmth and sun protection."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3c/Arm_warmers.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","full":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3c/Arm_warmers.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","title":"Arm warmers","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","creator":"Whatcanuexpect at English Wikipedia","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Arm_warmers.JPG","source":"Wikimedia Commons"},{"url":"https://api.openverse.org/v1/images/bcd4142e-5d73-4886-bf0a-caa3b44042cc/thumb/","full":"https://live.staticflickr.com/1675/24765289022_7e20742e85_b.jpg","title":"Arm Warmers & Toeless Socks (for TLC)","license":"BY-SA 2.0","creator":"Izzie Button (Izzie's)","page":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/48385543@N02/24765289022","source":"Flickr"},{"url":"https://api.openverse.org/v1/images/bcc68849-ac1e-4522-b219-f2c577479324/thumb/","full":"https://live.staticflickr.com/6087/6025459103_b7050a8054_b.jpg","title":"Knitted Arm Warmers","license":"BY-NC-ND 2.0","creator":"Ms Premise-Conclusion","page":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/46865073@N08/6025459103","source":"Flickr"},{"url":"https://api.openverse.org/v1/images/43b5b28e-cedb-4e36-b1a8-cf69098d8c54/thumb/","full":"https://live.staticflickr.com/7422/12101279203_005cfcac2c_b.jpg","title":"SNAP - Skater Arm-Warmers - Print 4","license":"BY-SA 2.0","creator":"Tigist Sapphire","page":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/73159597@N03/12101279203","source":"Flickr"},{"url":"https://api.openverse.org/v1/images/b176db1f-9abc-46bd-83f9-fd184fc96181/thumb/","full":"https://live.staticflickr.com/7390/12101279523_948915fefc_b.jpg","title":"SNAP - Skater Arm-Warmers - Print 3","license":"BY-SA 2.0","creator":"Tigist Sapphire","page":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/73159597@N03/12101279523","source":"Flickr"},{"url":"https://api.openverse.org/v1/images/90a5897a-2731-44ca-bfe6-f47bf72535b9/thumb/","full":"https://live.staticflickr.com/5482/12100994295_7debc2a7d4_b.jpg","title":"SNAP - Skater Arm-Warmers - Print 1","license":"BY-SA 2.0","creator":"Tigist Sapphire","page":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/73159597@N03/12100994295","source":"Flickr"},{"url":"https://api.openverse.org/v1/images/0dc756fe-6129-42a4-905a-085746c77dee/thumb/","full":"https://live.staticflickr.com/1943/30757181827_29c918d133_b.jpg","title":"20180218 1951 - Winterfire outfits - Clio - lace sweater, arm warmers - 53511931-11521974-08531932a3 (triptych)","license":"BY-NC-SA 2.0","creator":"Claire CJS","page":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/31355686@N00/30757181827","source":"Flickr"},{"url":"https://api.openverse.org/v1/images/e70e5a69-cb46-4ef8-b924-293365ce08ff/thumb/","full":"https://live.staticflickr.com/2445/3944361689_02a5c7e48f_b.jpg","title":"Arm Warmers","license":"BY 2.0","creator":"Incase.","page":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/62021300@N00/3944361689","source":"Flickr"},{"url":"https://api.openverse.org/v1/images/bea7e45e-91f6-43a9-9013-04b5f3013f09/thumb/","full":"https://live.staticflickr.com/2827/11480250546_016001456c_b.jpg","title":"SNAP - Arm Warmers (Plaid) & Mini Shirt (Peacock)","license":"BY-SA 2.0","creator":"Tigist Sapphire","page":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/73159597@N03/11480250546","source":"Flickr"},{"url":"https://api.openverse.org/v1/images/a6e47e6d-77bb-484f-ab25-ce5418a97aa5/thumb/","full":"https://live.staticflickr.com/1778/30058170448_057b8968ef_b.jpg","title":"20171209 2116 - fashion show - Clio - teal dress, knee-high pot leaf socks, skeleton arm warmers - 15a1632b25c (triptych)","license":"BY-NC-SA 2.0","creator":"Claire CJS","page":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/31355686@N00/30058170448","source":"Flickr"}],"links":{"studies":[{"title":"Effects of arm insulation on physiological responses during running in the cold.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28409513/","source":"The Journal of sports medicine and physical fitness","year":2018,"cites":1,"kind":"Clinical Trial"}],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Per aspera ad astra (strongman Koestrizer)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/per-aspera-ad-astra-strongman-koestrizer/213205","site":"T Nation · 8405 posts · 2015"},{"title":"Old Guy Strength","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/old-guy-strength/202537","site":"T Nation · 5970 posts · 2014"},{"title":"Silver and Steel","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/silver-and-steel/237353","site":"T Nation · 5436 posts · 2017"},{"title":"Boilerman Wants It All","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/boilerman-wants-it-all/254882","site":"T Nation · 4422 posts · 2019"},{"title":"TM79's Training Journal","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/tm79s-training-journal/273630","site":"T Nation · 4246 posts · 2021"},{"title":"Clockin' A Grip","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/clockin-a-grip/215284","site":"T Nation · 3804 posts · 2016"},{"title":"Atlas13 Burning the Boats","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/atlas13-burning-the-boats/259312","site":"T Nation · 3716 posts · 2019"},{"title":"Brute's Book","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/brutes-book/210950","site":"T Nation · 2469 posts · 2015"},{"title":"Magick's Training Log v2","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/magicks-training-log-v2/226628","site":"T Nation · 2177 posts · 2017"},{"title":"Old Guy Doing 5/3/1","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/old-guy-doing-5-3-1/201080","site":"T Nation · 1787 posts · 2014"},{"title":"Dig Through the Ditches","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/dig-through-the-ditches/169795","site":"T Nation · 1126 posts · 2011"},{"title":"Dadfit | 531 and Other Stuff","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/dadfit-531-and-other-stuff/282139","site":"T Nation · 846 posts · 2023"},{"title":"HT's What The Hell Am I Doing Part II","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/hts-what-the-hell-am-i-doing-part-ii/130214","site":"T Nation · 817 posts · 2009"},{"title":"Stormblessed Log - Tactical Barbell","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/stormblessed-log-tactical-barbell/287590","site":"T Nation · 765 posts · 2024"},{"title":"Ncsugrad's TRT Log / Diary","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/ncsugrads-trt-log-diary/256781","site":"T Nation · 688 posts · 2019"}],"news":[],"social":[],"web":[{"title":"Arm warmer - Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arm_warmer"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Style & presentation","chain":["Slip sleeves over forearms","Adds layered, patterned detail to an outfit","Alt aesthetic look"],"effect":"direct","text":"Arm warmers change how an outfit reads by adding stripes, colour or texture at the forearm. They are used to signal an alt aesthetic."},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":null,"lead":["Arm warmers are knitted sleeves for the arms; the term can also cover glove-like items without finger coverings that were originally meant to keep wrists and lower arms warm.[1] Dancers wear them to warm up before class, and they became a seasonal fashion item.[1]","Punk, emo, scene and goth subcultures adopted them as a fashion statement.[1] In current alt styling they are a common accessory for scene, e-girl and femboy looks, where they add layering and contrast to a short-sleeved top. The effect lasts only while worn.","Endurance athletes wear Lycra sleeves for insulation and UV protection.[1] One small study of twelve men examined the effect of arm insulation on physiological responses during running in the cold.[2]"],"infobox":[["Type","Clothing accessory"],["Material","Knit, or spandex/Lycra for sports"],["Subcultures","Punk, emo, scene, goth[1]"],["Outcome","Temporary, while worn"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["Arm warmers are tube-like sleeves worn on the forearm.[1] Sports versions in spandex or Lycra are said to reduce arm muscle swelling and lactic acid build-up, insulate in cold and provide UV protection.[1]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"In style culture","paras":["Punk, emo, scene and goth subcultures adopted arm warmers as a fashion statement.[1] During the 2010 FIFA World Cup, team-themed arm warmers became a phenomenon in South Africa and abroad.[1]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["A 2018 study of twelve healthy men found in a cold environment during running that arm insulation was examined for its effect on physiological responses; this concerns warmth, not appearance.[2]"],"subs":[]}],"lore":null,"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"Arm warmer","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arm_warmer","source":"Wikipedia","year":2026,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Effects of arm insulation on physiological responses during running in the cold.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28409513/","source":"J Sports Med Phys Fitness","year":2018,"type":"study"}],"studies":[{"title":"Effects of arm insulation on physiological responses during running in the cold.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28409513/","source":"J Sports Med Phys Fitness","year":2018,"kind":null}],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Per aspera ad astra (strongman Koestrizer)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/per-aspera-ad-astra-strongman-koestrizer/213205","site":"T Nation · 8405 posts · 2015"},{"title":"Old Guy Strength","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/old-guy-strength/202537","site":"T Nation · 5970 posts · 2014"},{"title":"Silver and Steel","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/silver-and-steel/237353","site":"T Nation · 5436 posts · 2017"},{"title":"Boilerman Wants It All","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/boilerman-wants-it-all/254882","site":"T Nation · 4422 posts · 2019"},{"title":"TM79's Training Journal","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/tm79s-training-journal/273630","site":"T Nation · 4246 posts · 2021"},{"title":"Clockin' A Grip","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/clockin-a-grip/215284","site":"T Nation · 3804 posts · 2016"}]}